##hero:bebop: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/bebop_sm.webp]] Bebop

###ability: Hook

- Hook T1 reduced from 30% more weapon damage to 25%

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/bebop/bebop_uppercut.webp]] Exploding Uppercut

- Exploding Uppercut T2 reduced from +60% weapon damage to +50%

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/bebop/bebop_sticky_bomb.webp]] Sticky Bomb

- Sticky Bomb damage reduced from 120 to 110
- Sticky Bomb T2 reduced from +80 Damage to +75

##hero:calico: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/nano_sm.webp]] Calico

- Bullet Damage increased from 2 to 2.2

###ability: Leaping Slash Radius

- Leaping Slash Radius increased from 4m to 4.5m

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/nano/nano_dash.webp]] Leaping Slash

- Leaping Slash T2 damage increased from +50 to +75

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/nano/nano_catform.webp]] Ava

- Ava now destroys breakables it runs through
- Ava T2 increased from 25% movespeed to 35%

##hero:holliday: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/astro_sm.webp]] Holliday

- Bullet damage growth increased from 1.5 to 1.7

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/astro/holliday_powder_keg.webp]] Powder Keg

- Powder Keg T2 reduced from 140 to 120

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/astro/holliday_crackshot.webp]] Crackshot

- Crackshot now triggers on units. Uses half cooldown when triggered this way.
- Crackshot damage reduced from 75 to 60
- Crackshot spirit scaling increased from 1 to 1.2
- Crackshot T2 increased from 75 to 85
- Crackshot T3 now also has -2s on creeps

- Fixed Crackshot applying Slowing Hex's anti-teleport debuff
- Spirit Lasso T2 duration increased from +0.5 to +0.75
- Fixed height on damage from Bounce Pad sometimes causing it to not hurt heroes on your lasso

##hero:kelvin: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/kelvin_sm.webp]] Kelvin

- Health increased from 600 to 650

##hero:mirage: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/mirage_sm.webp]] Mirage

- Fire Scarabs Max Health Steal reduced from 75 to 50
- Fire Scarabs Max Health Steal spirit scaling increased from 0.9 to 1.4

##hero:shiv: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/shiv_sm.webp]] Shiv

- Bullet Damage reduced from 5.7 to 5.5
- Slice and Dice damage reduced from 110 to 100
- Slice and Dice T2 reduced from +70 to +60
- Slice and Dice spirit scaling increased from 1.3 to 1.55
- Bloodletting deferred damage duration reduced from 13s to 12s

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/shiv/shiv_bloodletting.webp]] Bloodletting

- Bloodletting cooldown increased from 50s to 60s

##hero:vindicta: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/hornet_sm.webp]] Vindicta

- Movespeed reduced from 9 to 8
- Bullet Velocity reduced from 810 to 740

##hero:vyper: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/kali_sm.webp]] Vyper

- Bullet Damage decreased from 9 to 7
- Move Speed reduced from 7.3 to 7.0

###ability: Lethal Venom Max Damage

- Lethal Venom Max Damage reduced from 200 to 180

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/viper/viper_snakedash.webp]] Slither

- Slither T3 spirit and bullet resist while sliding reduced from +30% to +25%

##hero:wraith: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/wraith_sm.webp]] Wraith

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/wraith_card_trick.webp]] Card Trick

- Card Trick spirit scaling reduced from 1.1 to 0.9
- Card Trick cooldown increased from 0.65 to 0.75

- Card Trick summon rate from non-heroes reduced from 0.35 to 0.25

###ability: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/wraith_lift.webp]] Telekinesis

- Telekinesis silence and disarm duration increased from 2.5s to 3s

- Telekinesis cast delay reduced from 0.4s to 0.3s
- Telekinesis up/down motion now lasts 0.25s longer and moves a little bit higher

##hero:yamato: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/yamato_sm.webp]] Yamato

- Bullet damage growth reduced from 0.27 to 0.24

